            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizeleri depolayan değişkenleri de <code>fruit_1 == fruit_2</code> örneğindeki gibi birbirleriyle karşılaştırabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fruit_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fruit_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(fruit_1 == fruit_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>fruit_1</code>, ardından <code>==</code> ve son olarak <code>fruit_2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
